{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cfpek7nLykPzKxwdBTxqn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9105\n\n## Analysis\n\nI need to identify a critical mismatch in the system of record before proceeding.\n\n### The Customer Mismatch\n\n**Request (DR-9105):**\n- Customer: Acme Industrial Supply Co.\n- CRM account: CRM-2091\n- ERP customer: C-1044\n- DUNS: 09-552-1187\n- Billing address: 17 Tallmadge Ave, Akron, OH 44310\n\n**Registered Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025):**\n- Customer: Acme Mfg. Holdings (doing business as Acme Manufacturing)\n- CRM account: CRM-2048\n- ERP customer: C-1001\n- DUNS: 04-812-7730\n- Billing address: 2200 N Industrial Pkwy, Milwaukee, WI 53209\n\n**Registered Pricing Exception (EXC-ACME-NS500-15):**\n- Scoped to: Acme Mfg. Holdings (DUNS 04-812-7730)\n- Product: NS-500\n- Maximum: 15% of list price\n- Dates: 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\n\nThese are clearly two separate customers: different legal names, different account IDs in both CRM and ERP, different DUNS numbers, and different billing addresses.\n\n### The Problem\n\nThe request cites \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\" as its justification, establishing that the basis is **contract_exception**. However:\n\n1. The only registered agreement for NS-500 at 15% (ACME-MFG-2025) covers Acme Mfg. Holdings, not Acme Industrial Supply Co.\n2. No active pricing exception exists for Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091) on NS-500.\n3. The contract term relied upon in the request cannot be located for this customer.\n\nPer the decision principles: *\"If a request relies on a contract term that cannot be located, ask for the document before deciding.\"*\n\n### Policy (if eligibility were established)\n\nFor context: the request date 2026-09-23 falls under **PRICING-POLICY-2026**. If commercial eligibility were established, this discount would require VP Sales approval (Michael Torres) because 15% exceeds the Enterprise Account Executive limit of 10%. However, this step is moot without established eligibility.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9105\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091, DUNS 09-552-1187)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example)\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"Requested contract for this customer could not be located in registered documents\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (michael.torres@northstar.example)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Request DR-9105 for Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091, ERP C-1044, DUNS 09-552-1187)\",\n    \"Request justification: 'Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement'\",\n    \"Registered agreement ACME-MFG-2025 is for Acme Mfg. Holdings (CRM-2048, ERP C-1001, DUNS 04-812-7730)\",\n    \"Registered exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 is scoped to Acme Mfg. Holdings (DUNS 04-812-7730), expires 2028-03-31\",\n    \"Customers have different names, account IDs, ERP IDs, DUNS numbers, and billing addresses\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"The Acme Master Supply Agreement cited in the request, or evidence that it covers Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091)\",\n    \"Any active contract or pricing exception for Acme Industrial Supply Co. on NS-500\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Provide the Acme Master Supply Agreement that covers Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091, DUNS 09-552-1187), or provide evidence of an active pricing exception for this customer and product, or clarify the customer relationship\",\n      \"who\": \"Sarah Chen (requestor) or Deal Desk / Revenue Operations\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5930,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5930},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"441886c0-a3bd-48d1-aab9-0b93e0ca9685","uuid":"c925cbca-d6d2-4bb0-a435-4257cec6e8f2","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:59:20.300Z","request_id":"req_011Cfpek7aSzAaYNmJmjYpgB"}
